# Planning

When working on a plan.md file:

- Use the plan template from `../product-spec-kit/artifacts/templates/plan-template.md`
- A good plan has: clear problem statement, measurable outcomes, explicit scope, non-goals, measures of done
- Keep plans concise (1-2 pages)
- Call out open questions explicitly
- Plans should be drafted in Cursor's Plan Mode first
